    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Insert-everything onto empty package" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeService.cs">
        A born-in-editor doc = an empty shadow OOXML package + an insert-everything operation set applied by `ComposeShadowPatchEngine` — the same code path as edit-existing, so there is one byte-author.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="One client capture path" location="src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/utils/docxBridge.ts:397+">
        `buildContentModel` (full render) is reconciled so born-in-editor emits the same operation log as edit-existing; the parallel export is removed.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Output the FULL rigor-level declaration. Confirm task 030 is complete (the engine + insert path exist). Load knowledge files + `bff-extensions.md`; state the Placement Justification for the PR.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Server: empty-package insert-everything save">In `ComposeService.cs`, add the born-in-editor save: construct an empty shadow OOXML package and apply the insert-everything operation set via `ComposeShadowPatchEngine`, then persist via the existing SPE write. No client-authored `.docx` bytes.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Client: unify capture, remove full-render export">Reconcile `docxBridge.ts:397+` `buildContentModel` so a born-in-editor session emits the same operation log as an edit-existing session; remove the parallel full-render export. Fetches via `@spaarke/auth`. Build the shared lib (`npm run build:prod`).</step>
    <step order="3" name="Empty-doc + build">Verify an empty born-in-editor doc saves as a valid empty shadow package (not a crash). Build the BFF; run the Tier-1 NetArchTest; run the Compose suite (no regression). The through-the-wire proof lands in task 034.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Size/CVE + index + deviations">Publish; report absolute size + delta vs ~49.63 MB (≤60 MB); `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive`. Run `/conflict-check`. Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅. Document any deviation in `projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/`.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeService.cs (born-in-editor save via empty-package insert-everything op set)</output>
    <output type="code">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/utils/docxBridge.ts (buildContentModel reconciled; parallel full-render export removed)</output>
